paragraphs.text:
It is in pursuance of the said order of dismissal that the civil Court was approached

by the Government of Andhra Pradesh in OS No. 1497 of 1985 before the IV Additional Judge, City Civil Court, Hyderabad, inter alia, for the following reliefs:
"(a) the 'plaintiff be declared the owner of the plaint schedule land;
(b) the plaintiff be delivered possession of the plaint schedule land by evicting the defendant from it;
(c) the plaintiff be granted such other relief or reliefs as it is found entitled to under the law; and
(d) to award costs of the suit."
